{"c":{"281250":["Miyu Suzuki","Female","b281250-3Ce6zhYCFWtN.png","An energetic but self-conscious girl. She admires Tani for being the complete opposite of herself, but she can't interact with him normally and always ends up bothering him with pointless conversation.",1353],"281251":["Yuusuke Tani","Male","b281251-fpCKCGSQH6Rv.png","A quiet boy who clearly states his opinions. Suzuki always approaches him with a lighthearted vibe, but he always seems to reply curtly.",525],"302624":["Natsumi Nishi","Female","b302624-Uk2PVe27jAN6.jpg","A quiet and reserved girl from the class next to Suzuki and Tani who actually laughs at just about everything. She's extremely shy and bad at talking to classmates other than Honda. One of her main worries is always being a beat behind in conversations.",802],"302625":["Kentarou Yamada","Male","b302625-oRbYsCHt58tt.jpg","A cheerful, easygoing boy and classmate of Suzuki and Tani. He's the life of the party, open, honest, and quick to befriend anyone. He expresses his thoughts without holding back.",530],"302626":["Shino Azuma","Female","b302626-CNCys5MLLoMk.jpg","A mature-minded girl in Suzuki and Tani's class. Though she comes off as jaded, she's never experienced a proper romantic relationship.",1071],"302627":["Shuuji Taira","Male","b302627-6Udmewwwbani.jpg","A boy in Suzuki and Tani's class with a cynical attitude. Lacking confidence, he often compares himself to others and ends up feeling insecure or down.",1782],"354440":["Koyuki Hikawa","Female","b354440-baufwO1gkKDE.jpg","Haunted by past relationships, bullying, hostility, family issues, and the weight of her own expectations, she often erects emotional walls—rejecting others before giving them a chance to truly understand her",1434],"354442":["Miki Azumi","Female","b354442-FdfLbziapdYB.jpg","",243],"373190":["Aoi Satou","Female","b373190-LhFzMz1ALZkx.png","A quiet and cool-headed girl, also a classmate of Suzuki and Tani. Calm and reliable, she tends to observe her friends' love lives with a rational, objective perspective.",84],"373191":["Manami Watanabe","Female","b373191-e6bXmVqmJIGA.png","A cheerful, upbeat classmate of Suzuki and Tani. She's free-spirited and says exactly what's on her mind without hesitation.",116],"378435":["Rikako Honda","Female","b378435-NhrWQKUFcu9J.png","A girl from the same class as Nishi, with a dry, no-nonsense personality. She's logical and values efficiency in everything. She's close friends with Nishi and the only person Nishi communicates with normally.",144],"387018":["Miyu's Mother","Female","b387018-kXXaYkKaQ4KJ.png","",3],"387019":["Miyu's Brother","Male","b387019-v3Q0wE72LXAI.png","",1],"387020":["Morimo","Male","b387020-t4vm2ej0MMFn.png","",7],"387021":["Mini","Female","b387021-GG7P2cd2LQdo.png","",23],"387023":["Joshi A","Female","default.jpg","",0],"387024":["Joshi B","Female","default.jpg","",0],"387025":["Tannin","Male","b387025-p0FvodEaU3cb.png","",2],"387167":["Yusuke's Grandmother","Female","b387167-zMvMATsd0R8W.png","",6],"387168":["Reina","Female","b387168-hB43o8tSwwgI.png","",0],"387169":["Gekijou Announce",null,"default.jpg","",0],"387170":["Yeti",null,"b387170-HokRW6LpuoKX.png","",13],"387171":["Tempura",null,"b387171-adEdn5EWDHUQ.png","Yuusuke's pet cat.",20],"388227":["Yuusuke's Mother","Female","b388227-4WrlbyeMk1qN.png","",2],"388228":["Gomapon","Male","b388228-xEHvciy2Fx1E.png","Miyu's social studies teacher.",6],"389124":["Keikan","Male","b389124-XuEZQIWdfP4E.png","",0],"389125":["Hahaoya","Female","default.jpg","",0],"389940":["Kouchou","Male","b389940-9UJqrKJ9HJT6.png","",1],"389941":["Danshi","Male","default.jpg","",0],"389942":["Joshi","Female","default.jpg","",0],"390850":["Rihito Oka","Male","b390850-Add26fg2Jp1J.png","Miyu's classmate and ex-boyfriend from middle school.",2],"390851":["Joshi Chuugakusei","Female","default.jpg","",0],"390852":["Chuugaku no Tomodachi 1",null,"default.jpg","",0],"390853":["Chuugaku no Tomodachi 2",null,"default.jpg","",0],"390855":["Chuugaku